00:07:53.172 --> 00:07:55.641
If we're being honest about it,

00:07:56.075 --> 00:07:57.510
I mean,

00:07:57.877 --> 00:07:58.711
we are.

00:07:58.711 --> 00:07:59.812
What's interesting to me

00:07:59.812 --> 00:08:00.913
