00:08:04.350 --> 00:08:04.984
it seems.

00:08:04.984 --> 00:08:05.952
This is a

00:08:06.419 --> 00:08:09.055
proactive step to keep the judge down

00:08:09.055 --> 00:08:09.388
or not.

00:08:09.388 --> 00:08:10.189
It's pretty clear to me

00:08:10.189 --> 00:08:11.123
