00:08:18.865 --> 00:08:20.333
But he is in the crosshairs, right?

00:08:20.333 --> 00:08:22.001
I mean, I think it was an unforced error

00:08:22.001 --> 00:08:22.835
to not have them.

00:08:22.835 --> 00:08:23.703
And he acknowledged

00:08:23.703 --> 00:08:24.604
he admitted that

00:08:24.604 --> 00:08:25.671
I mean, obviously,

00:08:25.671 --> 00:08:26.739
there's the tangible things

00:08:26.739 --> 00:08:27.940
