00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:33.212
I think was an important step

00:08:33.212 --> 00:08:34.514
that even the transition

00:08:34.514 --> 00:08:35.748
secretary admitted.

00:08:35.748 --> 00:08:36.482
That being said,

00:08:36.482 --> 00:08:38.284
I mean, he he has this platform.

00:08:38.284 --> 00:08:40.219
It can be a powerful platform

00:08:40.219 --> 00:08:41.220
to raise his profile.

00:08:41.220 --> 00:08:42.088
We saw him,

00:08:42.088 --> 00:08:43.623
you know, sticking it to the airlines.

00:08:43.623 --> 00:08:44.190
He was also

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:44.590
at the center

00:08:44.590 --> 00:08:46.292
of the freight rail negotiations.

00:08:46.292 --> 00:08:48.227
And he's also been

00:08:48.227 --> 00:08:48.895
taking a lot of heat

00:08:48.895 --> 00:08:49.896
for these things as well.

00:08:49.896 --> 00:08:51.297
So there's the potential for blowback.

00:08:51.297 --> 00:08:52.932
And you see Republicans seizing on that.

